= Senator Riyo Chuchi of Pantora

Pantora’s young senator is honest to the point of naivety. That makes her surprisingly dangerous to cynics.

[? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : *Our advisors can act again in [+ advisor_action_timer +] turn(s).* ?]

- @chuchi_integrity: Pantoran integrity.
- @chuchi_rim: Outer Rim voices.
- @chuchi_troopers: Listen to the troopers.
- @go_back: Back.

@chuchi_integrity
subtitle: −1 corruption, +1 faith.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: corruption -= 1; faith += 1; advisor_action_timer = 5

Chuchi publishes her entire office’s accounts. Dozens of senators are suddenly very uncomfortable.

@chuchi_rim
subtitle: Cools Outer Rim separatism; +4 relations with the Rimward Coalition.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: outer_sep -= 3; rim_relation += 4; advisor_action_timer = 5

Chuchi tours refugee worlds on the Rim and brings their delegates to Coruscant to testify.

@chuchi_troopers
view-if: clones > 0
subtitle: The clones trust the Senate a little more.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: navy_loyalty += 3; clone_trust += 1; advisor_action_timer = 5

Chuchi visits a clone medical frigate and listens. The troopers are not used to being listened to.
